    {
      "name": "@kazuma-124/dsh-token-usage",
      "title": {
        "en": "Token usage",
        "zh": "Token 用量统计"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a Token usage entry to the left sidebar: totals, a per-project table and a trend chart, computed from local session logs without calling a model. The global total counts each consumption event once; parent and child project rows must not be added together. Read-only, loopback only, no write API.",
        "zh": "在左侧栏新增“Token 用量”入口：按对话、项目汇总 token 用量并显示趋势图，全部来自本机会话日志，不调用模型。全局总量只对原始消费事件汇总一次，父子项目的汇总行不能相加。只读、仅回环地址访问、无写入接口。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/dsh-token-usage.svg",
      "author": "Kazuma-124",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Kazuma-124/Personal_DSH_Plugins/tree/main/dsh-token-usage",
